          "text": "Amba kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Ncobeni ndi sinkondonyoko, O Zidoni. Njoolemezegwa akati kako, nkabela bayooziba kuti ndime Jehova nenzoobeteka makani mukati kawo anenzoosalazigwa mulinguwo. ",
